  {
   "id": "mars-base-194273@1.1",
   "gameId": "mars-base-194273",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-01-23T23:43:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The new patch 1.1 Mars Ranch update will be dropping in January. It’ll feature the ability for the players to raise and breed animal livestock, then eventually run a mini petting zoo or sell them off to the markets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This new Mars Ranch level features indoor and outdoor areas as well. There will even be new props for the Ranch and the home pod interior!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are three new buildings: Mars Barn, Coop and Train Loop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can store animals in the barn and coop, and travel using the train loop!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New animals include cows, goats, sheep, pigs, chicken and rabbits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New animals can be stored in the barn and coop!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "For some quality of life updates, we have added a new Mars wood resource, as well as inventory enhancements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve done a lot of work on the back end with bug fixes, updates, and more, so we hope you’ll check out the update in January! If you have any feedback or want more updates, check out our Discord and Twitter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
